      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PERFECT MIX (3) is generally an honest type in the frame at six of 16 starts but missed the placings last time when sixth (17.81) over 300m at this track. Tends to go well on this box draw. Well placed here and can go close with a clear run. RUNAWAY SAM (6) is a super honest type rarely out of the placings, including wins at his last two on end, the latest at The Gardens (15.89). Form at the trip sound including four wins. Super consistent and can feature with the right run. LET'S TROT WILL (1) turned in a plain effort last time when sixth at The Gardens over 400m behind Reborn Passion (23.75) in a Grade 4/5. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. A big run wouldn't surprise. MISS TWIX (8) is worth including after a top-three finish at this track and distance most recently.",
